<view class="page"><view class="brand">DAILY REVIEW</view><view class="title">从容接住，没做完的事。</view><view class="subtitle">先更新进度，再重新安排。截止日期由你确认修改。</view><button wx:if="!signedIn" class="primary" bindtap="login">登录后查看复查</button><block wx:else><button class="secondary" disabled="{{!access.canUse}}" bindtap="replan">按剩余时间重新安排</button><view class="card" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"><view><view class="badge" wx:for="{{item.reasons}}" wx:key="*this" wx:for-item="reason">{{reason}}</view></view><view class="name">{{item.title}}</view><view class="meta">剩余 {{item.remaining}} · {{item.deadline || '无截止日期'}}</view><view class="actions"><button class="secondary small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit">更新进度与时间</button><button class="primary small" disabled="{{!access.canUse}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="complete">已经完成</button></view></view><view class="empty" wx:if="!items.length">需要复查的事都已处理。</view></block></view>
